  <a href="index.html" class="nav-logo">DB<span>.</span></a>
  <div class="nav-center">
    <a href="index.html" class="nav-link">Home</a>
    <a href="works.html" class="nav-link">Works</a>
    <div class="nav-dropdown">
      <button class="nav-dropdown-btn active">
        Photography
        <svg viewBox="0 0 10 6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M1 1l4 4 4-4"/></svg>
      </button>
      <div class="dropdown-menu">
        <a href="street.html" class="dropdown-item">Street Photography</a>
        <a href="charak.html" class="dropdown-item">Charak — The Festival</a>
        <a href="varanasi.html" class="dropdown-item">Varanasi — The Holy City</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <a href="design.html" class="nav-link">Design</a>
    <a href="about.html" class="nav-link">About</a>
    <a href="experience.html" class="nav-link">Experience</a>
    <a href="contact.html" class="nav-link">Contact</a>
  </div>
  <a href="contact.html" class="nav-hire">Hire Me ↗</a>
</nav>

<div class="page-hero">
  <div class="hero-bg"></div>
  <div class="hero-glow"></div>
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <div>
      <div class="ph-tag">Photography</div>
      <h1 class="ph-h">The street<br>never lies.<br><em>Witness it.</em></h1>
      <p class="ph-sub">Three bodies of work. One obsession — the unguarded moment. Streets at different hours. Festivals in their rawest form. A city where time moves differently.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-right">
      <p class="hero-quote">"The same street holds different <em>emotions</em> at different times of the day."</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="series-section">
  <div class="ph-tag" style="margin-bottom:0">Three Series</div>
  <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-end;margin-bottom:0">
    <h2 style="font-family:var(--f-serif);font-size:clamp(1.8rem,3vw,2.8rem);font-weight:300;color:var(--text);line-height:1;margin-top:.75rem">Choose your <em style="font-style:italic;color:var(--gold)">series</em></h2>
  </div>
  <div class="series-grid" style="margin-top:2.5rem">

    <!-- Street Photography -->
    <a class="series-card" href="street.html">
      <div class="sc-thumb">
        <div style="width:100%;height:100%;background:linear-gradient(160deg,#0A0A08 0%,#1A1610 40%,#0C0C0A 100%);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:4rem">🏙️</div>
        <div class="sc-overlay"></div>
        <div class="sc-count">Series 01</div>
      </div>
      <div class="sc-body">
        <div class="sc-cat">Urban · Candid · Emotion</div>
        <div class="sc-title">Street<br><em>Photography</em></div>
        <div class="sc-desc">The street is a living stage — same frame, different hour, different story. Raw candid moments that reveal the soul of the city.</div>
        <div class="sc-foot">
          <span class="sc-tag">2024 · Kolkata</span>
          <div class="sc-arrow">→</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </a>

    <!-- Charak -->
    <a class="series-card" href="charak.html">
      <div class="sc-thumb">
        <div style="width:100%;height:100%;background:linear-gradient(160deg,#120808 0%,#2A1010 40%,#0E0808 100%);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:4rem">🔥</div>
        <div class="sc-overlay"></div>
        <div class="sc-count">Series 02</div>
      </div>
      <div class="sc-body">
        <div class="sc-cat">Festival · Ritual · Documentary</div>
        <div class="sc-title">Charak —<br><em>The Festival</em></div>
        <div class="sc-desc">One of Bengal's most intense religious festivals captured up close. Devotion, pain, and ecstasy — all on a single frame.</div>
        <div class="sc-foot">
          <span class="sc-tag">Documentary · Bengal</span>
          <div class="sc-arrow">→</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </a>

    <!-- Varanasi -->
    <a class="series-card" href="varanasi.html">
      <div class="sc-thumb">
        <div style="width:100%;height:100%;background:linear-gradient(160deg,#0A0808 0%,#1C1208 40%,#0A0A08 100%);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:4rem">🪔</div>
        <div class="sc-overlay"></div>
        <div class="sc-count">Series 03</div>
      </div>
      <div class="sc-body">
        <div class="sc-cat">Travel · Spiritual · Light</div>
        <div class="sc-title">Varanasi —<br><em>The Holy City</em></div>
        <div class="sc-desc">Where life and death coexist on the same ghat. Light on the Ganges. Smoke and faith. Varanasi through a lens that doesn't look away.</div>
        <div class="sc-foot">
          <span class="sc-tag">Varanasi · Ganges</span>
          <div class="sc-arrow">→</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </a>

  </div>
</div>

<div class="philosophy">
  <div class="phil-left">
    <div class="sec-tag">Philosophy</div>
    <h2>I don't shoot photos.<br>I <em>collect</em> moments.</h2>
    <p>Street photography is about presence — being invisible enough that life happens in front of your lens. Every series here was shot without direction, without setup. Just a camera, a street, and patience.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="phil-right">
    <div class="phil-stat"><div class="phil-stat-n">3</div><div class="phil-stat-l">Photo Series</div></div>
    <div class="phil-stat" style="border-left:1px solid var(--border)"><div class="phil-stat-n">1</div><div class="phil-stat-l">Award — IIT KGP</div></div>
    <div class="phil-stat" style="border-top:1px solid var(--border)"><div class="phil-stat-n">∞</div><div class="phil-stat-l">Hours on streets</div></div>
    <div class="phil-stat" style="border-top:1px solid var(--border);border-left:1px solid var(--border)"><div class="phil-stat-n">0</div><div class="phil-stat-l">Staged shots</div></div>
  </div>
</div>

<footer>
  <div class="footer-l">Debojyoti <em>Barat</em> · 2026</div>
  <div class="footer-links"><a href="index.html">Home</a><a href="works.html">Works</a><a href="photography.html">Photography</a><a href="design.html">Design</a><a href="about.html">About</a><a href="experience.html">Experience</a><a href="contact.html">Contact</a></div>
  <div class="footer-r">Kolkata · © 2026</div>
</footer>
